# Pick a named object with the arm.

# Request
# Open-vocabulary object name interpreted by the configured LLM/VLM detector.
string object_name
---
# Response

# Whether the arm completed the grasp motion and fresh gripper feedback
# confirmed that an object is held.
bool success

# Free-form status. On failure, identifies which stage broke:
#   "detection_failed: ..."
#   "grasp_pose_failed: ..."
#   "execute_grasp_failed: ..."
#   "timeout: ..."
string message

# The grasp pose chosen and executed. Its frame is supplied by grasp_pose
# (the current deploy uses arm/base_link). Fields are zero if no grasp pose
# was computed.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped grasp_pose

# Gripper opening for the chosen grasp (m). 0 if no grasp computed.
float32 gripper_width

# Score (heuristic / handler-defined) of the chosen grasp. 0 if no grasp.
float32 score

# How long the whole call took (s).
float32 elapsed_s
